    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Each share of phantom stock was the economic equivalent of one share of Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. common stock. This Form 4 is being filed to report the settlement of certain outstanding phantom stock awards in shares of Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. common stock on March 1, 2024.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Adjusted to reflect a three-for-two stock split on March 25, 2020.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Adjusted to reflect a three-for-two stock split on each of March 25, 2020 and September 10, 2012.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">Adjusted to reflect a three-for-two stock split on each of March 25, 2020, September 10, 2012 and August 24, 2010.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

